<mxCell id="q821" value="250 is the expected load per node, not a promise for one second. Slicing the JSON makes every read touch every node; a counter can be sharded because the reader sums." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="306" width="820" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
